Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Drowning in my shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(Aw shit!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(What a joke)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A couple thoughts rinsing loosely 'round my head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No escape, can't relate to this--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,(Indescribable dread)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.62,0:00:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,SO lather them up and don't question what's ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,(Liar)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,things aside, you've left inside as they prepare to-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm waters below
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.38,0:00:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch close as they ebb and flow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They're rushing in the wrong direction
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.62,0:00:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's another crazy obsession?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.58,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take a dunk in the dunk tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.54,0:00:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The duct tape's holding me alone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm soaked in shame down to the bone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your phones out for flash photography
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.86,0:00:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A splash of lukewarm mockery is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.44,0:00:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.68,0:00:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.98,0:00:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,need
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.32,0:00:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.62,0:00:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,drown
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.02,0:00:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,in everybody's shame!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.50,0:00:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.68,0:00:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,(oh, uh okay so you're just gonna-) OH, COME ON!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Head full of thoughts flood above my mental brim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.04,0:00:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Insanity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.88,0:00:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Calamity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.50,0:00:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all pitched on a whim
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,(BAM!)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.04,0:01:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on the mark!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.02,0:01:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's your damn apology?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,(Kill it)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.72,0:01:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,competition
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.36,0:01:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,ammunition locked
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.22,0:01:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but here's the key!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Exclude you with power
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dead in an hour
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.14,0:01:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't understand why they're mad - (at you! mad at you!) - anymore
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.06,0:01:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll say in good faith
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.42,0:01:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Their guilt is dehydrated
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel just like a human again
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When you make the time to get a\N
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.98,0:01:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Person you think is lesser than
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.36,0:01:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Kicked on the ground when they couldn't fucking stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.78,0:01:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So take a dunk in the dunk tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.70,0:01:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look around
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.56,0:01:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm past my goddamn freezing point
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.88,0:01:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll boil off my disappointment
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Check my temp and add some salt in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.68,0:01:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,While you cook me in a coffin cuz that's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.38,0:01:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.00,0:01:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,need
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.34,0:01:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.64,0:01:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,drown
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.02,0:01:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,in everybody's--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.84,0:01:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,SHAME!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.68,0:01:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(If you mess up, there aren't do-overs here!)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.96,0:01:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,(It's life or fucking death!)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.32,0:01:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Condensating
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.00,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Overrating
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.68,0:01:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Feeling both my lungs deflating
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Overflowing, barely showing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.30,0:01:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,See-through sea-like tides are flowing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.66,0:01:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull the cord and watch me spiral
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sinking quick - don't check my vitals!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My emotions start to rise like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,your devotion to my despise! 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(Woah, woah, woah! Nothing personal, but.... 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.10,0:02:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...is this what you're after?)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.70,0:02:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take a dunk in the dunk tank
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.12,0:02:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sponges take the blame
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how soft or absorbent
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.12,0:02:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not the most important?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ring me out in front of everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.94,0:02:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Insults are dry, but you're not done so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,take
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.98,0:02:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,fucking
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.30,0:02:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.30,0:02:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then end it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.30,0:02:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,all in the dunk tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.68,0:02:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Water's still and cold
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether or not the party's over
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Water down my pains exposure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss my target, paint a new one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Think and pray for what you're going through so
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,come
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.72,0:02:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.96,0:02:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,watch
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.32,0:02:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.58,0:02:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,shallow
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,cries!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,🎶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'M LYING!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,On my back, arms out and stretched
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,My mercy's all that's left and etched and
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.36,0:02:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though my reputation's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.68,0:02:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Water boarding all my stationed
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.06,0:02:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ins and outs and woahs and doubts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite my pleading and my shouts I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.72,0:02:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,cut
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.00,0:02:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,breath
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,short
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.36,0:03:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,now.
